11
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,580
What should we do?

12
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,680
I think we should try again.

13
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,040
Good luck.

14
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:16,140
Thank you.

15
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:17,460
Look, Mr. Jung.

16
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:19,360
Yes, sir.

17
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:21,260
You saw the news, right?

18
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:23,280
Yes, sir.

19
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:25,800
Are you sitting in the office with your ID stolen?

20
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,640
It's because of Mr. Ma.

21
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,760
I don't want to hear it. Hurry up and get out of here.

22
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,120
Yes, sir.

23
