Get out of here.

24
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:36,220
Yes, sir.

25
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,540
Run, run!

26
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,160
Don't even think of coming into the office before you get your ID stolen.

27
