Yes, sir. It's me.

28
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:21,570
Yes, sir.

29
00:04:21,570 --> 00:04:21,890
Oh, really?

30
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:35,230
You're back from school.

31
00:04:37,450 --> 00:04:38,050
Hello.

32
00:04:38,730 --> 00:04:39,250
Welcome.

33
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:43,770
I see that two of our future husbands are here.

34
00:04:45,370 --> 00:04:46,570
Oh, it's you, Mom.

35
00:04:47,230 --> 00:04:49,230
Yes, they're good at studying.

36
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:51,150
What's going on?

37
00:04:51,550 --> 00:04:54,070
Our future husbands are here.

38
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:55,710
Oh, Mom.

39
00:04:57,230 --> 00:04:59,190
What are you doing?

40
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:00,730
Our future husbands are here.

41
00:05:01,150 --> 00:05:03,350
We should give them some snacks.

42
00:05:03,350 --> 00:05:04,130
What are you doing?

43
00:05:04,810 --> 00:05:05,190
Snacks?

44
00:05:05,850 --> 00:05:07,170
Don't eat them.

45
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:08,070
Hey!

46
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:10,350
Get a hold of yourself.

47
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:13,730
Are you going to go into a girl's house without any manners?

48
00:05:14,470 --> 00:05:17,650
I don't want to go into a girl's house.

49
00:05:18,170 --> 00:05:20,770
My nickname is Piglet.

50
00:05:21,150 --> 00:05:22,810
What? You're a piglet?

51
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:24,750
Oh, stop it.

52
00:05:25,110 --> 00:05:28,430
I'll prepare a lot of snacks for you tomorrow.

53
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:31,170
Take good care of Mi-ra.

54
00:05:31,930 --> 00:05:32,850
Yes, ma'am.

55
00:05:32,850 --> 00:05:33,350
Goodbye.

56
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:34,510
Goodbye.

57
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:35,770
Goodbye.

58
00:05:35,770 --> 00:05:36,450
Goodbye.

59
00:05:40,010 --> 00:05:42,270
How did you get caught by Mi-ra?

60
00:05:42,830 --> 00:05:43,830
You should have a good reputation.

61
00:05:47,290 --> 00:06:11,870
You look like a clown.

62
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:17,400
