63
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,380
No, I was just kidding.

64
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,580
I'll see you later.

65
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:27,750
This is not their house.

66
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:30,350
From now on,

67
00:07:30,470 --> 00:07:32,430
