68
00:07:33,490 --> 00:07:37,750
If you disobey orders or leave the group,

69
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:40,290
you'll be sent to a special training camp.

70
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:40,950
Do you understand?

71
00:07:41,910 --> 00:07:42,750
Yes, sir.

72
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:43,990
Look at their answers.

73
00:07:45,690 --> 00:07:47,070
Let's all say it out loud.

74
00:07:48,130 --> 00:07:48,990
Do you understand?

75
00:07:49,570 --> 00:07:50,410
Yes, sir!

76
00:07:51,550 --> 00:07:52,950
We'll start with the first part.

77
00:07:53,410 --> 00:07:55,110
If you say, let's go together, three people will gather.

78
00:07:56,170 --> 00:07:56,770
Let's go together!

79
00:07:57,350 --> 00:07:58,110
Let's go together.

80
00:07:58,950 --> 00:08:02,290
Mi-ra, Mi-ra, Mi-ra, Mi-ra, Mi-ra, Mi-ra.

81
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:03,270
Yes, sir.

82
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:04,450
Stop right there.

83
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,100
Hey, you two, get up.

84
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,060
Look at these guys.

85
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:16,680
Who's a man and woman in one room?

86
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,820
Yes, sir.

87
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,460
Who's that?

88
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:24,540
Yes, it's my uncle and uncle.

89
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,480
Good.

90
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:32,740
To help you get a grip on your mental state,

91
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:36,140
I'm going up to the camp as a candidate from now on.

92
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:36,320
Let's go.

93
00:08:38,850 --> 00:08:40,220
Let's all jump!

94
00:08:40,600 --> 00:10:24,490
It's all because of you.

95
00:10:24,830 --> 00:10:25,730
Who's the girl next to Mi-ra?

96
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,530
So what are you going to do?

97
00:10:29,310 --> 00:10:30,930
I'm going to beat her up.

98
00:10:37,710 --> 00:10:38,580
Hey, you!

99
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:40,820
Yes, sir.

100
00:10:41,060 --> 00:10:41,940
Don't do anything stupid.

101
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:43,920
Yes, sir.

102
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:46,280
Get yourself together by the time you get to the camp.

103
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,700
Yes, sir.

104
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,740
One, two, three.

105
00:11:09,970 --> 00:11:11,550
Actually, I feel the same way.

106
00:11:12,330 --> 00:11:13,470
My back hurts.

107
00:11:14,930 --> 00:11:16,750
Should we sit with our backs together?

108
00:11:17,570 --> 00:11:19,910
Yes, let's do that.

109
00:11:20,970 --> 00:11:21,830
Let's do it together.

110
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:40,380
Hyuk, stop!

111
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:43,260
Why are you screaming? You're scaring me.

112
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,180
Is he here?

113
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:50,020
I don't know.

114
00:11:50,660 --> 00:11:51,740
I don't want to.

115
00:11:52,020 --> 00:11:53,080
Stop it!

116
00:11:56,940 --> 00:11:58,460
I almost fell.

117
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:01,100
Why are you guys so angry?

118
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,460
Look over there.

119
00:12:03,340 --> 00:12:03,760
Where?

120
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:05,540
There's a light in the forest.

121
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:07,860
You're lying.

122
00:12:08,300 --> 00:12:09,820
It's true, isn't it?

123
00:12:10,220 --> 00:12:10,820
Yes.

124
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:11,520
Let's go.

125
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:13,620
Mi-ra! Mi-ra!

126
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,860
Don't go!

127
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:16,660
Don't come if you're scared.

128
00:12:17,140 --> 00:12:17,940
I'll go check.

129
00:12:18,940 --> 00:12:20,360
No, I...

130
00:12:24,130 --> 00:12:26,130
What are you doing? Come on.

131
00:12:28,650 --> 00:12:31,050
She's a woman. She's not scared at all.

132
00:12:38,820 --> 00:12:39,690
What's that?

133
00:12:41,970 --> 00:12:42,970
Over there.

134
00:12:44,310 --> 00:12:47,460
Mi-ra, what's that?

135
00:12:47,460 --> 00:12:48,320
It's a goblin.

136
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:49,760
Where's the goblin?

137
00:12:50,580 --> 00:12:52,300
Mi-ra, let's not go.

138
00:12:52,300 --> 00:12:54,260
Don't come if you're scared.

139
00:12:59,090 --> 00:12:59,970
I'm scared!

140
00:13:09,190 --> 00:13:11,390
Mi-ra! Mi-ra!

141
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:14,250
What if we get lost?

142
00:13:14,930 --> 00:13:15,870
You fool.

143
00:13:16,110 --> 00:13:17,150
You'll never find the right way.

144
00:13:17,990 --> 00:13:18,830
Follow me.

145
00:13:25,940 --> 00:13:27,260
Anyway, let's go to the south.

146
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,760
Let's give up and go back. I'm scared.

147
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:36,440
Do you know the way back?

148
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,960
Can't we just go back?

149
00:13:39,390 --> 00:13:42,160
Don't be silly. Follow me.

150
00:13:50,700 --> 00:13:51,600
Fools.

151
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,100
It's night time.

152
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:54,820
Night time?

153
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,040
Follow me.

154
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:25,180
Where is this place?

155
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:30,000
What should we do?

156
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:31,880
Look over there.

157
00:14:32,020 --> 00:14:33,180
There's a cave over there.

158
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:33,880
Where?

159
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,760
Let's go in there.

160
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,700
What if there's a bear?

161
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:41,680
It's better than staying here.

162
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,180
Let's go inside the cave.

163
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:48,220
Wait for me!

164
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:57,010
There's a flashlight.

165
00:14:57,650 --> 00:14:58,170
Turn it on.

166
00:15:08,620 --> 00:15:09,760
It's a huge cave.

167
00:15:10,580 --> 00:15:11,640
Okay.

168
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,260
Let's go inside.

169
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:16,020
No, I don't want to.

170
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:18,580
Hold my hand.

171
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:20,140
Mi-ra, you go first.

172
00:15:20,140 --> 00:15:20,580
Okay.

173
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:40,810
Don't look at me.

174
00:15:41,330 --> 00:15:50,720
Let's go.

175
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,780
Let's find another way.

176
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,720
Hey, let's go that way.

177
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:53,040
Okay, let's go.

178
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:58,840
Who's there?

179
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:05,520
I'm scared.

180
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:10,060
My name is Lukas.

181
00:19:10,780 --> 00:19:13,540
I'm from a planet 80,000 light years away from this planet.

182
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:15,960
Alien?

183
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:19,880
Why do you live in such a dark and scary cave?

184
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:23,860
I was a scientist from a planet Aria.

185
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:29,300
But I fell in love with Joana, who made me do my research.

186
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:33,600
So I became a chef from a planet Aria.

187
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:38,320
It was already 999 years ago.

188
00:19:39,580 --> 00:19:40,180
What?

189
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:43,900
999 years ago?

190
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:44,960
That's right.

191
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:47,880
Now my research is in the final stage.

192
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:54,380
If I complete the super-precise ejection device of this planet Aria,

193
00:19:55,060 --> 00:19:56,700
I can go back to the planet Aria.

194
00:20:00,040 --> 00:20:01,200
I'm starting to run out of energy.

195
00:20:01,980 --> 00:20:04,040
That's why I'm looking for an energy source.

196
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,080
You guys...

197
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:08,920
The goblin from before...

198
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:10,140
That's right.

199
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:11,680
I'm dizzy.

200
00:20:23,300 --> 00:20:26,000
Mister, please send us back.

201
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:29,100
We'll help you as much as we can.

202
00:20:33,050 --> 00:20:35,210
I want to do that, too.

203
00:20:36,010 --> 00:20:39,410
The strong electromagnetic waves from my body

204
00:20:39,570 --> 00:20:41,570
will be transmitted to you.

205
00:20:42,390 --> 00:20:44,390
It's a threat to Joana's planet.

206
00:20:47,050 --> 00:20:48,430
Then what should we do?

207
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:50,130
Is there no other way?

208
00:20:51,710 --> 00:20:53,110
There's only one way.

209
00:20:54,170 --> 00:20:56,770
Before you get exposed to Joana's planet,

210
00:20:58,050 --> 00:20:59,350
can you find an energy source?

211
00:21:03,010 --> 00:21:03,750
I'll try.

212
00:21:06,650 --> 00:21:09,470
If you can find that source,

213
00:21:10,110 --> 00:21:12,910
I'll give you a strong super-precise ejection device.

214
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:18,850
What's that source?

215
00:21:21,230 --> 00:21:24,150
I don't know which source will release that energy.

216
00:21:27,650 --> 00:21:29,390
You have to find it.

217
00:21:30,610 --> 00:21:32,610
Now, let's go back.

218
00:21:32,610 --> 00:21:38,340
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

219
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:39,820
Follow that light.

220
00:21:58,150 --> 00:22:17,240
Mister Lucas, thank you!

221
00:22:17,340 --> 00:22:18,660
What happened?

222
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:20,360
Nothing.

223
00:22:21,300 --> 00:22:22,080
Really?

224
00:22:34,220 --> 00:22:34,960
Mira!

225
00:22:36,520 --> 00:22:39,040
I'm sorry. You waited a long time, didn't you?

226
00:22:39,460 --> 00:22:41,040
You were late decorating the place.

227
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:43,080
Thank you for the invitation.

228
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:44,840
Oh, my!

229
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:46,760
Thank you.

230
00:22:49,110 --> 00:22:50,300
You're so reliable.

231
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,940
You protected Mira well as you promised.

232
00:22:53,900 --> 00:22:55,360
So, have fun today.

233
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:58,700
No, Mira was braver.

234
00:22:58,860 --> 00:23:01,200
Yes, we're safe because of her.

235
00:23:02,060 --> 00:23:04,060
What are you talking about?

236
00:23:04,820 --> 00:23:05,600
We're not aliens.

237
00:23:05,760 --> 00:23:06,900
Are you dreaming?

238
00:23:08,070 --> 00:23:10,240
It means that Mira protected us.

239
00:23:10,980 --> 00:23:11,640
Right?

240
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,680
Oh, my!

241
00:23:14,680 --> 00:23:16,600
How can you be so kind?

242
00:23:16,600 --> 00:23:19,320
Oh, my!

243
00:23:19,800 --> 00:23:24,860
I wish we could be friends from now on.

244
00:23:25,980 --> 00:23:26,940
Me too.

245
00:23:28,020 --> 00:23:28,940
What's wrong?

246
00:23:29,600 --> 00:23:30,780
Oh, it's daddy.

247
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:33,980
Daddy, come here.

248
00:23:34,080 --> 00:23:35,280
Mira, I bought you a birthday gift.

249
00:23:36,300 --> 00:23:38,300
Oh, my friends are here, too.

250
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:39,920
You're late.

251
00:23:47,720 --> 00:24:14,060
Did you catch the electromagnetic waves?

252
00:24:14,860 --> 00:24:17,480
Yes, over there.

253
00:24:32,660 --> 00:24:34,140
I can feel the strong electromagnetic waves.

254
00:24:35,220 --> 00:24:36,680
They must be in here.

255
00:24:37,620 --> 00:24:38,500
Let's go.

256
00:24:58,760 --> 00:25:03,260
That's the super-magnetic energy emitter

257
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:06,040
Go and find them.

258
00:25:06,460 --> 00:25:07,880
Yes, ma'am.

259
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,800
They must be dead by now.

260
00:25:24,560 --> 00:25:27,920
This super-magnetic emitter is in our hands.

261
00:25:34,260 --> 00:25:35,800
The electromagnetic waves are strong,

262
00:25:36,300 --> 00:25:37,880
but we can't see them.

263
00:25:42,560 --> 00:25:43,660
They can't have gone far.

264
00:25:44,260 --> 00:25:45,040
We have to catch them.

265
00:26:22,210 --> 00:26:23,910
What's going on?

266
00:26:25,950 --> 00:26:27,010
Let go of me!

267
00:26:27,150 --> 00:26:27,650
What are you doing with her?

268
00:26:32,070 --> 00:26:45,930
Let go of me!

269
00:26:55,790 --> 00:26:57,530
Don't move!

270
00:27:04,980 --> 00:27:05,460
Don't move!

271
00:27:37,380 --> 00:27:39,700
Calm down.

272
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:41,440
Sister!

273
00:27:42,080 --> 00:27:42,900
Don't be angry.

274
00:27:51,260 --> 00:27:53,220
What happened to Mira?

275
00:27:53,220 --> 00:27:54,320
Where is she?

276
00:27:54,340 --> 00:27:57,120
Oh, my friends, Mira is sick.

277
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:58,420
Sister!

278
00:27:58,860 --> 00:27:59,560
Are you okay?

279
00:28:00,220 --> 00:28:01,400
She's in a coma.

280
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:10,700
Doctor, how is Mira?

281
00:28:10,940 --> 00:28:12,980
How is she, doctor?

282
00:28:13,620 --> 00:28:16,200
She's doing her best, but...

283
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:17,900
Oh, my sister!

284
00:28:19,300 --> 00:28:21,020
Calm down.

285
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:22,420
Calm down.

286
00:28:31,790 --> 00:28:33,890
Please help us, Maria.

287
00:28:34,210 --> 00:28:34,690
Please help our friend Mira,

288
00:28:34,690 --> 00:28:38,790
who is the kindest and prettiest in the world.

